""},"say:12:1223208023:1":{"text":"누가 네 형님이야? 입바른 소리는 됐어!","source_cn":"谁是你哥们？客套话就免了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49A1BF6C509C80C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223208024:1":{"text":"이렇게 된 거, 다음번에 또 찾아주시면 싸게 일해 드리죠.","source_cn":"不打不相识，下次您找我们干活，给您友情价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBE87164173C8175","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1223208025:1":{"text":"흥, 말은 잘하네. 이만 가봐.","source_cn":"哼，你还算上道，走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ED7208E8CDAA4D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1223208026:0":{"text":"와, 정말 세심하시네요. 다음 일거리도 챙긴 거잖아요.","source_cn":"看不出来嘛，你还算细心，懂得为自己招揽生意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0454276D5ADA9C29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1223208027:1":{"text":"다 요즘 배운 것들이지요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님. 감사합니다. 여러분이 없었다면 오늘은 정말 큰일 날 뻔했어요.","source_cn":"都是这段时间学会的，太感谢<style=stress>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3388C043496E7E1E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다 요즘 배운 것들이지요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님. 감사합니다. 여러분이 없었다면 오늘은 정말 큰일 날 뻔했어요.","female":"다 요즘 배운 것들이지요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님. 감사합니다. 여러분이 없었다면 오늘은 정말 큰일 날 뻔했어요.","variant_male_record_index":"139905","variant_female_record_index":"139906","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1223208028:0":{"text":"세실, 파스를 불러와. 영지로 돌아가자.","source_cn":"西索，去叫上帕斯，该回营地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12AD88F5139DBB2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1223208029:0":{"text":"파스는 상태가 안 좋아서 먼저 돌아갔어.","source_cn":"帕斯他情况不太好，已经先回营地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3705D0241397385","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1223208030:0":{"text":"또 왜?!","source_cn":"又咋了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADFEBA0D065764E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1223208031:1":{"text":"가보면 알 거야.","source_cn":"你去看看就知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09E6A91EC2477EA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"원가만 갚을게","source_cn":"我们只赔成本价","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8330E8E02FB6ED43","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"원가만 갚을게","female":"원가만 갚을게","variant_male_record_index":"67582","variant_female_record_index":"67583","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1223208006:1":{"text":"맞아요! 허가를 받은 상선이라면 모두 출하 기록이 있을 거예요. 거기서 무슨 과일인지 확인하고 시세에 맞게 배상할게요!","source_cn":"没错，每艘官方认可的商船都会有出货记录，我们要确定那是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD258C113CFBEE182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1223208007:1":{"text":"만약 증거를 대지 못한다면 밀수해 온 과일이라는 얘기겠죠. 블러디 로즈가 안다면... 곤란해질 텐데요!","source_cn":"如果你不能提供证据，就说明你这几箱水果是偷渡的……如果...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE612C7BE74FB7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1223208008:1":{"text":"윽... 그, 그게 말이지...","source_cn":"呃……这个这个嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A96D4742EB9048D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1223208009:1":{"text":"증거가 없다면 블러디 로즈에게 알리진 않겠어요. 하지만 배상은 원가로 할게요!","source_cn":"如果没有进出货证明的话，我们可以不举报给血薇帮，但只能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31DC6D97FE309334","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1223208010:1":{"text":"어때요, 이 정도면 꽤 성의 있지 않나요?","source_cn":"怎么样，很有诚意吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B0295E58B6BE56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1223208011