물건을 잃어버렸으니 배상하는 건 당연하죠.","source_cn":"当然没有这意思，他弄丢了货物，赔偿是应该的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04E276BB77EEC4B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1223208016:1":{"text":"하지만 그는 아직 일당도 못 받았어요. 이건 어떻게 배상하실 거죠?","source_cn":"但他连工钱都没拿到，怎么有钱赔你呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8DB6129D5DB28EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1223208017:1":{"text":"세실에게 배상을 받고 싶다면 먼저 일당을 주셔야죠!","source_cn":"为了让他有钱赔你，你要先结清工钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFC090B9C425C2B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1223208018:1":{"text":"...그건 또 맞는 말이군.","source_cn":"……好像有点道理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40FC81C95D21F515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1223208019:1":{"text":"아니, 아니! 이렇게 하면 내가 받을 배상금이 줄어들잖아? 하마터면 넘어갈 뻔했네!","source_cn":"不，不！这样我得到的赔偿就少了，好险，差点就被你们糊弄了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC100381DE8C92F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1223208020:1":{"text":"그래, 똥 밟은 셈 치고 조금 깎아주지.","source_cn":"这样吧，给你们少一点，算我倒霉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x210A8C6B30554029